{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-eden-house-the-canal","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"eden-house-the-canal","about":"Discover Eden House - The Canal, by H&amp;H Development, This architectural gem, strategically located alongside the Dubai Water Canal in the prestigious Jumeirah area, redefines contemporary living. Eden House - The Canal is not just a residence, but a lifestyle statement by H&amp;H Development.Residents can choose from a variety of living options ranging from cozy studios to luxurious 4 bedroom suites, spacious garden duplex units, and 3 exclusive penthouses that epitomize opulence. Each residence is meticulously designed with the occupant's experience as a central focus. It boasts a modern, low-rise profile that perfectly complements its waterfront environment, blending harmoniously with the land, sea, and sky.The interiors of Eden House are a masterclass in elegance, featuring high-quality, tactile materials that create a rich sensory experience. The color palettes are carefully chosen to provide a sense of warmth and balance, making each home a serene sanctuary. One of the most striking features of these homes is the floor-to-ceiling windows that not only bathe the interiors in natural light but also offer unparalleled views of the Arabian Gulf, turning every glance outwards into a moment of awe.","price":3200000,"title":"Eden House The Canal","bitrix":{"id":73,"pf_id":"are.3.13310","source":null,"project_id":"Jumeirah 2","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Eden House The Canal","property_type":"Penthouse","developer_name":"H&H Development","project_location":"Jumeirah"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/eden_house_feature_36edad1c5f.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/eden_house_feature_36edad1c5f.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.1957799,"lng":55.2355798},"country":"dubai",